3
00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:39.650
Täna laseme moe uuesti kapist välja
ning uurime, kas mood on kunst.

4
00:00:39.979 --> 00:00:41.980
Kas see, mis mul seljas on,
on kunst,

5
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.760
