40
00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:44.640
Et selles mõttes, et, et ma tundsin,
et,

41
00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:48.639
Et, et alati,
kui sul on mingi nagu praktiline

42
00:02:48.639 --> 00:02:51.000
